class MyHashSet {

    private boolean[] set;

    public MyHashSet() {
        set = new boolean[1_000_001];
    }

    public void add(int key) {
        set[key] = true;
    }

    public void remove(int key) {
        set[key] = false;
    }

    public boolean contains(int key) {
        return set[key];
    }
}
:::

## How it works

Think of the array as a collection of boxes:

```text
key:       0   1   2   3   4   5   ...
set:      [F] [F] [T] [F] [T] [F] ...
